sPod Firmware 0.9.2
Release date: 2026-06-09

Summary
-------
Small UI polish release for Settings and navigation ergonomics.

Added
-----
- Settings screen now displays the firmware version at the bottom.
- Firmware version shown in Settings is read from the ESP-IDF app descriptor,
  so it matches the actual image metadata.

Changed
-------
- Back button touch target in the shared top bar is larger and easier to hit.
- Top bar title alignment was adjusted to leave room for the larger Back button.
- Firmware version source is centralized through the VERSION file and ESP-IDF
  PROJECT_VER metadata.

Fixed
-----
- Avoided keeping a second manually maintained runtime version header.
- Reduced missed taps on Back navigation.

Functional Notes
----------------
- The release export script will now package this release under Releases\0.9.2.
- The generated release flasher will still flash bootloader, partition table,
  and app image from the selected release folder.
